   "title": "体験版について",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "本作に体験版はございません。<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/9142\" target=\"_blank\">https://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/9142</a>"
